AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The Matrix series is available now through the DECdirect and Electronic
Store services and local Digital sales offices. All software kits include
two cables (LAN relay and EIA232) plus media and documentation, for easy
quoting and use. See the June 1994 edition of the Systems and Options
catalog for specifications and configuration information.

All UPS models include an input cord with an L6-30R plug, output
receptacles, and battery packs (one for 3 kVA units and two for 5 kVA
models). Worldwide models include IEC type receptacles only.

PDU modules plug into an L14-30R or L6-30R on the rear panel of the UPS to
provide plug-and-play extension of a standard outlet configuration. The -AA
variant can be daisy chained for multiple PDU provisions.

