SERVICE

The Matrix series products are warranted for two years, including batteries,
via an option-swap, user-return process through APC. The hot swap warranty
includes APC shipping of a module replacement within 24 hours of a service
call, with the return of the failed module within 30 days.

Three-year onsite warranty packages include pickup and exchange within 24
hours of a service call. This exchange service is administered by APC and
provided by Digital. In addition, onsite replacement services are available
through a Digital service contract.

