Atria's ClearCase Software Configuration Management

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Premier software configuration management product for UNIX and
   open-systems-based development teams

o  Provides advanced version and source control, workspace management, build
   management, and process control with unique, non-intrusive approach that
   appeals to both software engineers and development managers

o  Provides critical support for software development teams upgrading from
