PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Development teams need software configuration management (SCM) products to
help develop, release, maintain, and store large amounts of software, with
maximum productivity, quality, coordination, and security. Specifically,
engineers need concurrent, easy access to multiple versions of source code
and other software elements, along with rapid workspace setup and accurate
system building. Managers need to know that software in development and
maintenance is securely stored and that good software development practices
are enforced.

Traditional UNIX tools for version and source code control, such as RCS and
SCCS, lack the functionality, power, and scalability to meet these
challenges. Home-grown SCM tools suffer from maintenance burdens and limited
functionality. Process oriented, bureaucratic SCM tools impede developer
productivity and are inflexible.

Comprehensive, flexible SCM systems are required, and Digital has found
Atria Software's ClearCase to be the best SCM system it can offer its users.

The ClearCase SCM product for UNIX development teams provides advanced
version control and source control, workspace management, build management,
and process control, without forcing developers to change their tools or
development style. The product's transparent and customizable approach to
process control helps developers enhance productivity and quality, supports
software reuse, and reduces the time-to-market.

