Digital will integrate ClearCase as the SCM system within its COHESIONworX
distributed UNIX software development environment, which supports computing
platforms from multiple vendors. COHESIONworX software is the foundation for
client/server support in a COHESION solution. It supports integrated
development through its implementation of the CORBA standard, using
Digital's ACA Services, and is available for Digital, Hewlett-Packard, and
Sun workstations.

