On-Tap SOFTWARE FOR OpenVMS AND DOS AVAILABLE IN EUROPE

On-Tap V4.0 for OpenVMS and DOS systems is now shipping in Europe. On-Tap is
the only soft font bar code software available. Running on OpenVMS VAX
systems, it enables character cell terminal users to design, modify, and
incorporate bar codes into their documents. The codes can be enlarged,
reduced, or rotated at 90 degree intervals, and the bar width can be
narrowed or widened. On-Tap software is also available for DOS based
personal computers.

This application independent product lets you print the bar codes easily on
Digital's dot matrix, laser, and inkjet printers. Digital's related product,
the DECwand bar code reader, can read and decode all industry standard
symbologies. Together, the software, the reader, and the variety of printers
constitute a comprehensive, flexible, easy-to-install, and cost effective
bar code solution that fully supports Digital's Record Managment Service.

