PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

RoamAbout Mobile IP mobile client/server networking software enables mobile
users with portable computers to connect to their company's network wherever
they are working. And because these portable computers keep their permanent
IP network address or obtain a temporary one through DHCP (Dynamic Host
Configuration Protocol), independently of their physical location, mobile
users have the same level of service both in the workplace and away from it.

BENEFITS

o  Mobile users who cannot afford to leave their work can access files,
   services, and applications in their home office environment from anywhere
   on the corporate network and through any WAN access.

o  Mobile users can participate in a network through the resident DHCP
   server now offered in V2.0, thereby conserving the use of IP addresses
   for easier manageability.

o  Password functions have been enhanced, to help maintain a more secure
   network.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

