SPECIFICATIONS

o  Programming interface:
   - DOS Terminate and Stay Resident (TSR) driver (DECtalk PC compatibility
     mode).
   - Applications program calls via a communication port.
o  System interface: RS232/423 serial (no telephone line interface).
o  System requirements: 25 KB memory (TSR) for DOS.
o  Communication setup: 9600 baud, 8 bits per character, no parity, 1 stop
   bit.
o  Speaker: internal, 2 inch diameter.
o  Inputs: text, phonemes, and speech control commands.
o  Audio output: 1/8 inch stereo headphone jack, >16 ohms impedance, 300 mW
   maximum.
o  Controls: combined On/Off and Volume.
o  Power: integral battery pack and a 115 Vac, 60 Hz external power wall
   cube.
o  Dimensions: 3.6 inches wide, 7.6 inches long, 1.3 inches high.
o  Weight: 15 oz.
o  Charge time: 4 hours maximum.
o  Speaking time: 4 hours minimum (continuous speech).
o  Accessories included: carrying case, detachable accessory pouch,
   headphones, 9 pin RS232 connector, 2 ft cable, external power wall cube.

