PATHWORKS V5.0A FOR DOS AND Windows

PATHWORKS V5.0A for DOS and Windows client software lets users configure
PATHWORKS components around their network operating systems (including LAN
Manager, NetWare, and Windows for Workgroups) without manual intervention.
Supported clients include those using:

