The V5.0A release also includes all software corrections generated since
V5.0 shipped in January 1994. Starting with this release, PATHWORKS for DOS
and Windows client software is now available on CDROM, requiring access to a
CDROM reader (ISO 9660). Note that setup and troubleshooting diskettes are
included in the CDROM media kit for users who have not established a network
connection. Thus the CDROM media and documentation kit consists of one CDROM
and six diskettes.

The PATHWORKS V5.0A for DOS and Windows update software is available now:

